          "value": "<p>@Template[type:emanation|distance:10]{10 feet} @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.v61oEQaDdcRpaZ9X]{Aura}</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature enters a space occupied by the hazard;</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Any creature starting their turn in or entering the area must make a @Check[type:reflex|dc:16|basic:true] and takes fire damage (as noted in the attack listed in the actions section).</p>\n<p>Creatures inside the Steam Aura are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} to all creatures outside of the steam and all creatures outside the steam are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} to all creatures inside the steam.</p>"
