    "details": {
      "description": "<p>A vent in the floor nearly indistinguishable from any other vent, when a creature stands on it releases a 10x10 burst of steam, dealing fire damage and concealing the area for one turn.</p>",
      "disable": "<p>On a successful disable, the Steam Vent is disabled.</p>\n<p>To disable the Hazard, 2 successes are required on either a @Check[type:Nature|dc:16|name:Disable Arcing Horns|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained), @Check[type:crafting|dc:16|name:Arcing Horns|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained), or @Check[type:Theivery|dc:16|name:Disable Arcing Horns|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained) check.</p>",
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 0
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "",
        "license": "OGL",
        "remaster": false,
        "title": ""
      },
      "reset": "",
      "routine": "<p>The Aura increases in diameter by 5 feet up to a maximum of 20 feet total aura, any creature that is in the increased aura size must make a @Check[type:reflex|dc:16|basic:true] and takes fire damage (as noted in the attack listed in the attacks section).</p>\n<p>Creatures inside the Steam Aura are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} to all creatures outside of the steam and all creatures outside the steam are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} to all creatures inside the steam.</p>"
    },
